(627,'British Chamber of Commerce EU & Belgium',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(628,'BritCham EU is part of the British Chamber of Commerce EU & Belgium and it focusses on all matters concerning EU policy and the relationship between the UK and the EU. The organisation promotes the importance of fair and open business in Europe and aims to help influence policies which facilitate and support businesses both in the EU and in the UK to thrive and succeed in this context.',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(629,'It\'s programme is delivered through the various activities and events originated by our committees and/or through our strategic partnerships.',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(630,'https://www.britcham.eu',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(631,'Make UK Partners',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(632,'Make UK partners with a range of external partners to help us deliver reports, surveys, events, conferences, and campaigns - supporting us in helping British businesses to grow, innovate, and prosper.',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(633,'Our extensive knowledge of UK manufacturing means we’re able to speak with authority and represent the views of UK manufacturers at UK (regional, national) and European levels.',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(634,'Information on the Partners we work with is listed below.',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(635,'https://www.makeuk.org/about/our-partners',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:03'),(636,'ISOCARP - International Society Of City And Regional Planners, https://isocarp.org/',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:05'),(637,'EuRIC',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:06'),(638,'EC2027',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:06'),(639,'YERUN - Young European Research Universities (https://yerun.eu/)',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:06'),(640,'EUA - European University Association (https://eua.eu/)',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:06'),(641,'CESAER - the strong and united voice of universities of science and technology in Europe (https://www.cesaer.org/)',NULL,'2025-05-15 22:18:06'),(642,'FEU is a member of EENA and a number of our 