 Energy Directive, Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive, Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive, Media Freedom Act, AI Act','2025-05-15 22:15:04'),(199,'Our main EU targeted policy and interest is the Growth Plan for the Western Balkans (2024), where we would like to cooperate with European Commission, by presenting investment plans for the energy development of the regions and obtaining their support Beside that, with our main business activities we can contribute to the:','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(200,'- Directive (EU) 2023/2413 on the promotion of the use of energy from renewable sources (Recast Renewable Energy Directive - RED III)','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(201,'- Directive (EU) 2023/1791 on energy efficiency (Recast Energy Efficiency Directive)','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(202,'- Communication from the Commission – REPowerEU Plan (COM/2022/230) According to Slovenia’s National Energy and Climate Plan (NECP), the country aims to reach a share of at least 27% renewable energy in final energy consumption by 2030 Through PV and wind development and participation in national grant schemes (eg for solar PV installations), Interenergo contributes directly to achieving these national targets','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(203,'- Communication from the Commission – The European Green Deal (COM/2019/640)','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(204,'Artificial Intelligence Act','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(205,'Artificial intelligence liability directive','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(206,'Data Act','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(207,'General Data Protection Regulation','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(208,'Connectivity','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(209,'Cyber Security Regulation','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(210,'Occupational health and safety','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(211,'Foreign Direct Investment Screen Regulation','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(212,'Strategic Technologies for Europe Platform','2025-05-15 22:15:05'),(213,'Alle EU-Initiativen, -Strategien und -Rechtsetzungsvorhaben im Bereich Pflanzenschutzmittel, Düngemit