s as organized / directed /  promoted and published by the EU Commission DG MOVE For example the EU Regulation(s) 300/2008 185/2010 and 2015/1998 address in particular the work our members as Aviation Security Validators are doing The Commission has invited our organisation to be part of the \"Stakeholders Advisory Group on Aviation Security (SAGAS)\" to receive advise used in the \"Aviation Security Committee (AVSEC)\"','2025-05-15 22:16:41'),(778,'The Fit for 55 Package, Hydrogen and Decarbonised Gas Markets Package, REPowerEU','2025-05-15 22:16:42'),(779,'Position papers are published here: https://netzeroallianceeu/publications/','2025-05-15 22:16:42'),(780,'Our organization aims to participate in the EU initiative ‘Call for Expressions of Interest from EU/EEA-based businesses to invest in Ukraine’ and, in this context, we engage with EU policies and legislative proposals related to economic recovery and investment in Ukraine Specifically, we focus on:','2025-05-15 22:16:43'),(781,'•	The Ukraine Facility (COM(2023) 338 final), which outlines EU financial support for Ukraine\'s reconstruction','2025-05-15 22:16:43'),(782,'•	The European Fund for Sustainable Development Plus (EFSD+), facilitating private sector investments in third countries, including Ukraine','2025-05-15 22:16:43'),(783,'•	The Neighbourhood, Development, and International Cooperation Instrument (NDICI) – Global Europe (Regulation (EU) 2021/947), which provides funding for sustainable investments','2025-05-15 22:16:43'),(784,'•	The EU’s broader Reconstruction and Recovery Plan for Ukraine, ensuring economic resilience and private-sector participation','2025-05-15 22:16:43'),(785,'Proposition et recommandation concrètes de politiques européennes relatives à l\'action extérieure et des relations Europe - Afrique: Il s\'agit','2025-05-15 22:16:44'),(786,'-  Des accords de partenariat avec les pays d’Afrique, des Caraïbes et du Pacifique (ACP) et la stratégie commune Afrique-UE','2025-05-15 22:16:44'