pplies to the planned amendment to the Passenger Rights Regulation and the rules on free hand luggage (EU Regulations No 261/2004 and 2027/97) We are also following the developments of the VAT package for travel and tourism, possible amendments to the Tobacco Products Directive (2014/40/EU), particularly with regard to the impact on the travel-retail sector, as well as the introduction of national deposit return systems as part of the Packaging and Packaging Waste Regulation (P9_TA(2024)0318) In general, we follow European transport policy, in particular sea and air transport issues, legislation relating to products sold in travel retail, customs and taxation, including travelers allowances, and other relevant legislation for the travel-retail market','2025-05-15 22:16:58'),(871,'We follow legislative files and initiatives related to telecommunications, digital, data protection and data economy, cybersecurity and sustainability This includes, among others, the following legislative proposals: Gigabit Infrastructure Act, Data Act, Digital Markets Act, AI Act, ePrivacy Regulation, e-evidence, GDPR, Cyber Resilience Act, EU Taxonomy, etc','2025-05-15 22:16:59'),(872,'As a company headquartered in the UK and with a European-wide footprint serving businesses and governmental institutions with ICT solutions, we take a strong interest in the future EU-UK relationship','2025-05-15 22:16:59'),(873,'Environment,','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(874,'Safety and Technical matters','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(875,'Research and development,','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(876,'Industry policy,','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(877,'Trade and Competitiveness policies','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(878,'Competition policy,','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(879,'Transport policy,','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(880,'Social Dialogue and Skills','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(881,'Defence','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(882,'Energy Transition Partnership for EU Fisheries and Aquaculture','2025-05-15 22:17:01'),(883,'- Le Pacte Vert pour l\'Europe 