 Sky initiative and related institutions like EASA, SESAR3 JU, EDA, the SESAR Deployment Partnership, Eurocontrol Agency, the European Green Deal and the \"fit for 55\" initiative','2025-05-15 22:17:53'),(1223,'The Good Lobby’s mission is to enhance the advocacy capacity of civil society organisations while making corporate lobbying more transparent, ethical, and sustainable (“good lobbying”)  As such TGL does not lobby the EU institutions but provides advice on how to do so to a variety of stakeholders, in the following policy areas: Transparency & Integrity, Sustainable corporate governance, Consumer rights, Digital rights, Animal rights and welfare, Energy and Health In addition, our office monitors the following EU policy areas with a view to engaging in awareness-raising and/or advocacy activities vis-à-vis the EU institutions as and when the opportunity presents itself: Conference on the Future of Europe, Rule of Law framework, Ongoing response of the EU institutions to the Russian war of aggression in Ukraine, Transparency of the legislative process, including trilogue negotiations','2025-05-15 22:17:54'),(1224,'The EUROPARC Federation is active – both in terms of advocacy and implementation – in the following policy areas:','2025-05-15 22:17:55'),(1225,'EU Environmental Action program EU biodiversity strategy EU Green Deal Nature Directives Water Framework Directive Nature Restoration legislation EU Action Plan for People, Nature and Economy EU strategy for Smart, Sustainable & Inclusive Growth EU Vision to 2050 Roadmap to a Resource Efficient Europe Green Infrastructure Strategy EU Youth Strategy 2019-2027 EU Solidarity Corp initiative Common Agricultural Policy (CAP) EU Cohesion Policy EU 2050 Climate Strategy European Territorial Cooperation (ETC) Invasive Alien Species regulation Coexistence between people and large carnivores (European Platform) LIFE regulation','2025-05-15 22:17:55'),(1226,'At international level EUROPARC is also working in close coope