19:08'),(1719,'In 2025, our advocacy work will focus on the following policies: Common Agricultural Policy and Common Organisation of the Markets (CMO) Regulation policy proposals from the new Vision for Agriculture and Food Public Procurement Directives Proposal for a Regulation of the European Parliament and of the Council on plants obtained by certain new genomic techniques and their food and feed Regulation on plant reproductive material International Trade European Protein Strategy Nature Regulation Soil Monitoring Law Regulation on the protection of animals during transport European Water Resilience Strategy','2025-05-15 22:19:08'),(1720,'- Stratégie pour le marché unique,','2025-05-15 22:19:09'),(1721,'- Plans d\'actions nationaux,','2025-05-15 22:19:09'),(1722,'- Passeport de services','2025-05-15 22:19:09'),(1723,'Green Deal & Circular Economy','2025-05-15 22:19:09'),(1724,'Waste Framework Directive - Packaging and Packaging Waste Directive - Taxonomy - EU ETS - Battery Regulation','2025-05-15 22:19:09'),(1725,'EFICIENCIA ENERGÉTICA','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1726,'ECONOMÍA CIRCULAR','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1727,'INDUSTRIA 40','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1728,'EDIFICIOS DE CONSUMO CASI NULO','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1729,'PACTO EUROPEO POR EL CAMBIO DEMOGRÁFICO','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1730,'INDUSTRIA CONTRACT','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1731,'NATURE BASED SOLUTIONS','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1732,'PATRIMONIO','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1733,'TURISMO','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1734,'AGUA Y ENERGÍA','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1735,'DESARROLLO TERRITORIAL','2025-05-15 22:19:10'),(1736,'CELAC-EU Policy Forum on Development','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1737,'- Retail investment strategy (RIS)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1738,'- Financial Data Access (FIDA)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1739,'- Solvency II','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1740,'- Capital Market Union','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1741,'- Sustainable Finance policies (Taxonomy, SFDR, CS3D)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1742,'- Digital Finance Strategy (incl Artificial Intelligence Act, Open Finance/ Insurance)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1743,'- Data Protection (including Data Act)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1744,'- Cybersecurity issues (DORA)','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1745,'This list is not exhaustive','2025-05-15 22:19:11'),(1746,'Join and Participate in the Critical Medicines Alliance, a consultative mechanism which brings together all relevant stakeholders, to identify priorities for action and propose solutions to strengthen the supply of critical medicines in the EU, to better prevent and combat their shortages','2025-05-15 22:19:12'),(1747,'DIRETTIVA (UE) 2018/410 DEL PARLAMENTO EUROPEO E DEL CONSIGLIO del 14 marzo 2018 che modifica la direttiva 2003/87/CE per sostenere una riduzione delle emissioni più efficace sotto il profilo dei costi e promuovere investimenti a favore di basse emissioni di carbonio e la decisione (UE) 2015/1814','2025-05-15 22:19:12'),(1748,'COMUNICAZIONE DELLA COMMISSIONE Orientamenti relativi a determinati aiuti di Stato nell’ambito del sistema per lo scambio di quote di emissione dei gas a effetto serra dopo il 2021','2025-05-15 22:19:12'),(1749,'Transposition de la directive 2019/790','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1750,'Transposition de la directive 2011/77','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1751,'Révision du règlement 2027/97','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1752,'Mise en œuvre de la CITES','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1753,'Socle européen des droits sociaux','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1754,'Droit à la négociation collective pour les travailleurs indépendants (guidelines DG COMP)','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1755,'Mise en œuvre de la résolution du Parlement sur un cadre de l’Union pour la situation sociale et professionnelle des artistes et des travailleurs des secteurs de la culture et de la création (2023)','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1756,'AI Act','2025-05-15 22:19:13'),(1757,'European Defence Fund (EDF) activities','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1758,'ASAP and EDIRPA related activites','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1759,'Commission expert group on policies and programmes relevant to EU space, defence and aeronautics industry','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1760,'Pharmaceutical company \"Darnytsia\" is actively engaged in advocating for regulatory harmonization between the European Union (EU) and Ukraine in the pharmaceutical sector Our main legislative proposals and policies targeted towards the EU include:','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1761,'Harmonization of EU Law with Ukrainian Legislation: We advocate for the alignment of Ukrainian pharmaceutical regulations with EU standards to facilitate trade and ensure the quality and safety of medicines in both markets This includes promoting the adoption of EU directives and regulations related to pharmaceutical manufacturing, distribution, and quality control','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1762,'Creation of a New Controlling Body: We support the establishment of a dedicated regulatory authority or controlling body in Ukraine modeled after EU agencies such as the European Medicines Agency (EMA) This body would oversee the approval, regulation, and monitoring of pharmaceutical products to ensure compliance with international standards and promote public health','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1763,'Mutual Recognition of GMP Certificates with the EU: We propose the mutual recognition of Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP) certificates between Ukraine and the EU This would streamline the process for Ukrainian pharmaceutical companies to obtain EU GMP certification, facilitating access to the European market and promoting cross-border trade in pharmaceutical products','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1764,'Alignment with EU Pharmacovigilance and Clinical Trial Regulations: We advocate for Ukraine to align its pharmacovigilance and clinical trial regulations with EU requirements This includes enhancing transparency, safety monitoring, and reporting of adverse drug reactions, as well as adopting standardized protocols for conducting clinical trials in line with EU guidelines','2025-05-15 22:19:14'),(1765,'ANASF follows the evolution of European legislation in the field of financial and insurance services, sustainable finance as well as all issues related to financial education','2025-05-15 22:19:15'),(1766,'In particular, ANASF follows the evolution of Mifid, CRD Directive, the IDD Directive, the Kid Priips Regulation, UCITS funds Directive and all the rules relating to sustainable finance','2025-05-15 22:19:15'),(1767,'Sprawiedliwość i sprawy wewnętrzne - problematyka wymiany informacji, baz danych, ochrony danych osobowych, retencji danych, współpracy w sprawach karnych i cywilnych','2025-05-15 22:19:16'),(1768,'Zagadnienia związane z polityką obrony (defense) i współpracy PCz w zakresie wspólnych zakupów i bliższej współpracy pomiędzy przemysłem zbrojeniowym','2025-05-15 22:19:16'),(1769,'Energetyka i problematyka związana z zielonym ładem/Fitfor55, zagadnienia związane z polityką odpadową (PPWR)','2025-05-15 22:19:16'),(1770,'Problematyka usług finansowych','2025-05-15 22:19:16'),(1771,'Industriestrategie und Industriepolitik, konkrete VO, hier insbesondere: GPSR, CBAM, EcoDesign, Kunststoffverordnung, Regelungen Lebensmittelkontakt, Regelungen zu Liefferkettengesetzgebung,','2025-05-15 22:19:16'),(1772,'Research and Technology (H2020 and Horizon Europe), Next Framework Program (FP10), European Defence Fund (EDIDP), ReFuelEU Aviation','2025-05-15 22:19:17'),(1773,'- Capital Market Union,','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1774,'- Fiscalité (ACCIS, fiscalité du numérique)','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1775,'- InvestEU','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1776,'- Skills Agenda','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1777,'- Autorité européenne des marchés financiers','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1778,'- Concurrence et Commerce','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1779,'- Energie','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1780,'- Cohésion','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1781,'- Budget, incl CFP post 2020','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1782,'- Stratégie industrielle de l\'Union','2025-05-15 22:19:18'),(1783,'- Défense','2025-05-15 22:1